  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん……？　あそこにいるのは真乃じゃないか？）",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020010,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ピーちゃんとお出かけするの、久し振りだね\r\nほわ～いいお天気できもちいいね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（真乃、鳥に話しかけてるな\r\n声をかけていいものかどうか……）",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0096"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私ね、最近忙しくなってきたんだよ\r\nレッスンに、オーディション。それから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ユニットを組んで活動することになって……\r\n私、本当にアイドルになっちゃったんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "気が付けば進みだしてて……\r\n私、本当にライブに出ていいのかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ピーちゃんはどう思う？\r\n…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（黙り込んでしまった\r\nそろそろ声をかけた方がよさそうだ）",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーっと……真乃？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0095"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ、プロデューサーさん？\r\nどうしてここに？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たまたま真乃を見かけてね\r\n真乃が連れてる……その鳥は？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "この子は家で飼っているピーちゃんですっ\r\n今日は一緒にお散歩をしていました。お話もしたり——",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー……真乃。実はさっきの話、聞こえてたんだ\r\n盗み聞きみたいになって……悪いな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ～、ピーちゃんに相談してたの、\r\n聞かれちゃったんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、聞いてた\r\nアイドルをやる自信がないのかな？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……こんなこと言ってていいのかなぁって思うんですけど\r\nでも……自信が持てないんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃は今までアイドルとしての活動を\r\n頑張ってきたじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "苦手なダンス練習も一生懸命やってきただろ？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私はただ、アイドルになるのに必要だって言われたことを\r\nやってただけなんです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "灯織ちゃんはいつも一生懸命\r\nめぐるちゃんは楽しそうにやってる",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "イルミネーションスターズのユニットの中で、\r\n私はちゃんとできてるかなって……思ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020120"
  },
  {
    "select": "レッスンは\r\nつらいだけだったのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "もっと自信持っていいよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "真乃はこれから伸びるよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020130,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "つらい？　つらい……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020131,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いいえ、楽しかったです",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020131"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それにレッスンが終わった後、\r\n胸の中までポカポカしてきて……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim3": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ポカポカ？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、ええっと、なんて言うんだろう？\r\nうーんうーん……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim3": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020151,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……その、ポカポカなんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim3": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020151"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんとなく……わかった気がする",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃がそう思えるのは、真乃の心がアイドルになりたいって\r\n思ってるからじゃないかな？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……\r\n私はアイドルになりたいんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim3": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃にはアイドルの資質があるんだ、俺が保証するよ\r\n後は、真乃が俺を信じてくれるかどうかだけだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私はプロデューサーさんを信じてます",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim3": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……まだ自分がアイドルでいいのか分かりませんけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim3": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんを信じてますから、\r\nこれからもユニットの活動を頑張っていきます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim3": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "むんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim3": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020211,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……そうなんでしょうか？\r\n……自信を持つ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、それだけのことを真乃はしっかりやってる\r\n言われたからってだけじゃないはずだよ？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、私なりにやれることをやってるつもりです……\r\nレッスンも、オーディションも",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim3": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも全然足りてない気がしているんです\r\n私は本当にしっかりできてるんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "心配しなくてもできてるよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今のペースで頑張れば、\r\nちょっと足りない自信も、すぐに身に付くはずだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……そうだったんですね……\r\n私、自信を持ってライブに出たいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim3": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "まだまだ不安でいっぱいですけど、\r\nプロデューサーさんの言うことを信じて頑張ります",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim3": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうしよう",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私……なんだかレッスンがしたくなってきました\r\n身体を動かしたいですっ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ピーちゃんを家に連れて帰りますね\r\nその後、レッスンさせてくださいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020280,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ピーちゃん、また一緒に遊ぼうね\r\nその時は愚痴を聞かせたりはしないから、むんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim3": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020290,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……これから……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim3": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はまだ少し自信がないのかもしれない\r\nでも真乃は充分頑張ってるし、絶対に伸びるから",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020300,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……私は私なりに頑張ろうって思っています\r\nだけど私には素質がないのかも、って気がしていました",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim3": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはないよ\r\n初めて会ったときから、真乃にはアイドルの素質を感じた",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "多くの人を笑顔にできる、素敵なアイドルになれるよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020310,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私が多くの人を笑顔に……ほわぁ\r\n今までそんなこと、考えたこともなかったです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim3": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020320,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私、プロデューサーさんの言葉を信じたい……\r\nだって誰かを笑顔にできるなんて素敵ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim3": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、信じてよ\r\n俺の言葉を、真乃自身を",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020330,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい……私、もっと頑張れる気がしてきました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim3": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100102/1001001020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001020340,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさんっ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim3": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
